WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.368
Dozens of Ukrainian troops

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.336
are wrapping up their training in Spain.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:04.437
On the left

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:05.205
for two tanks

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:06.639
Western allies agreed to send

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.575
to help Ukraine in its fight.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:09.976
This is part of a coordinated effort

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:11.011
with Spain, Germany,

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.278
Norway, Poland, Portugal

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.414
and the Netherlands to supply Kiev

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.483
with around 80 leopard two vehicles.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.052
Our next guest is a US Army veteran

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.321
who has been fighting alongside Ukrainian

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:22.389
since the beginning

00:00:22.389 --> 00:00:23.723
and sharing his experience

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.158
with us from the ground.

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:26.493
We're happy to join Mira Popovich

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.261
or have him join us here.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:30.430
He is back in the US for the first time

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.664
since the start of the war.

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:32.899
Mira, thank you.

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:33.867
We appreciate you joining us.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.101
Good morning to you.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.369
So we're happy to see that you're safe.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.371
You're heading back to Ukraine tomorrow.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.773
Your assessment of where you think

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:41.708
this war is one year out.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.743
And I mean, you've been,

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.845
you know, fighting for a year.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:47.747
Well, you know, since day one,

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.416
I think the whole world was giving

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.117
us, what, two, three days?

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.486
And here we are one year later and

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:54.988
we are fighting back. And

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:57.390
our armed forces

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.360
have liberated much of our territory.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.029
I know it's still a long way to go, but,

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:04.631
you know, we are on the right track,

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:05.131
of course,

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:07.300
obviously, with the support from Europe

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.401
and the United States.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:09.769
And the whole world

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.905
that cherishes the freedom

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.840
and the human rights.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.575
Now, with all that help,

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.309
we are on the right

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:18.078
track to

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.313
end this war as soon as possible.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:21.548
You said you're surprised

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:23.716
that it's still going on even this long.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:24.818
We hit the one year mark.

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:26.586
We talked about what that meant.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.221
What is it like being on the ground

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:28.855
there you get

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:29.522
when you've been told

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:30.623
who's been there, you're going

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:31.524
back is done.

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.393
What is it like there?

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:34.994
Well, you know what

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:37.363
I can say, it's horrible.

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:39.399
And it'll be the right statement.

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:40.800
But, you know,

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.734
we as humans,

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.503
we can get used to anything.

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:45.905
And probably one year later,

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:49.109
I get used to seeing horrible

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.043
and tremendous things

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.544
or being under fire.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:52.479
You get used to this,

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:55.582
but it's not normal, obviously, now.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:58.251
But it is I tell you this.

00:01:58.551 --> 00:01:59.085
I want to.

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:01.354
It is amazing

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:04.390
to see how united Ukrainians are

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.427
and the whole world around us and to see

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:09.662
from any.

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:10.730
I've been to Kharkiv,

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.832
Hertzel Nicolai of Kiev,

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:14.701
all these cities

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:17.070
and everywhere you see people united

00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:20.240
It's amazing.

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:21.841
Yeah.

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.443
Why did you come back

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:24.911
to the United States?

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:27.113
I have to find my Texas United States.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.982
I mean, as a citizen,

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:31.017
I haven't flown North Texas in 21.

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:33.419
And I have to file for 22.

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:35.455
And my driver's license was expiring.

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:36.089
My U.S.

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:37.223
passport was expiring

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.825
because it's been a long time.

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:39.926
So I had to come here

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:41.961
and you know, do those little things.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:42.461
And

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:46.833
and the other thing is, Andrew, leave

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:48.067
Newark from Boombox,

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.637
you know, the Pink Floyd guy

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:52.305
you had the guy who sang with Pink Floyd.

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:53.973
We are in the same team.

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:56.676
So he came here with a tour with his band

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:59.646
Boombox to raise money for Ukraine.

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:01.948
Humanitarian and military aid.

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:02.882
So I'm here

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:05.051
sort of helping him out as well.

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:06.386
One big thing we've been talking about

00:03:06.386 --> 00:03:06.886
this morning

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:08.588
is also the politics here at home

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:10.223
and support for Ukraine,

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:11.157
because we've heard

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:12.258
Biden in the admin

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:13.726
talk about supporting Ukraine

00:03:13.726 --> 00:03:14.928
as long as it takes.

00:03:14.928 --> 00:03:16.296
But Ron DeSantis is someone

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:18.431
who is expected

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:20.133
to enter the Republican race.

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:22.001
He is polling the closest

00:03:22.001 --> 00:03:23.436
to Trump of anyone else.

00:03:23.436 --> 00:03:24.871
And he said last night

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:25.939
he doesn't think the US

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:26.573
should be involved

00:03:26.573 --> 00:03:27.540
in what he called

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.741
a territorial dispute

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:30.643
between Ukraine and Russia.

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.111
Are you worried

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:33.546
about the future politics here

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:35.281
and how that affects support for Ukraine?

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.349
What's this guy's name?

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:37.217
Ron DeSantis.

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:38.251
He's from the Sanders

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:40.687
a Florida yeah, I heard his name as well.

00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:42.522
I want to let him know

00:03:42.522 --> 00:03:44.824
that this is not the territorial dispute.

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:48.394
Russia is has invaded

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:52.098
Ukraine to destroy, demolish, rape, kill.

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:53.032
And

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:56.102
it's it's not a territorial dispute.

00:03:56.102 --> 00:03:58.738
So hopefully this guy doesn't win.

00:03:58.738 --> 00:03:59.372
But

00:04:02.008 --> 00:04:03.643
But what was the question again?

00:04:03.643 --> 00:04:05.511
Just the concern about support,

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:06.813
what the support could look like

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:07.647
and the US

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:09.682
commitment and

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:11.150
broader commitment to Ukraine.

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:12.151
Of course,

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:14.787
you know, the United States

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:16.990
supports Ukraine very much.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.725
And I am concerned

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:20.526
if the support will stop,

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:23.129
it'll be harder for us because

00:04:23.129 --> 00:04:25.999
we already paid the highest price,

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:27.000
the ultimate price.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.402
I mean, tens of thousand people died.

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:32.105
And I've seen the cities demolished.

00:04:32.805 --> 00:04:34.841
For example, for instance, city of Kiev

00:04:34.841 --> 00:04:35.975
where 10,000 people live

00:04:35.975 --> 00:04:37.143
there is demolished.

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:40.747
100% there is no more, there's no more.

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:42.181
The city doesn't exist anymore.

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:44.851
So this is not a territorial dispute.

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:46.286
This is life or death.

00:04:46.286 --> 00:04:48.154
So as someone said, if

00:04:48.154 --> 00:04:50.290
Russia stops shooting,

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.457
there'll be no war.

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:53.026
If Ukraine stops shooting, there'll

00:04:53.026 --> 00:04:54.894
be no Ukraine. So

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:58.631
that's exactly what is happening.

00:04:58.631 --> 00:04:59.799
Before you go, can we

00:04:59.799 --> 00:05:01.501
can you tell us what your shirt,

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:03.569
the shirt. Yes.

00:05:03.569 --> 00:05:06.306
This is the Saint Javelin shirt

00:05:06.306 --> 00:05:08.441
props to Saint Javelin

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:09.809
I think it's the Saint Mary

00:05:09.809 --> 00:05:10.977
that's holding a javelin

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:12.445
and they call it, say,

00:05:12.445 --> 00:05:14.113
the protector of Ukraine,

00:05:14.113 --> 00:05:14.881
which obviously has been

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:16.549
critical for Ukraine. Yes.

